                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The unauthorized sharing of private health data\u2014including pregnancy status, prescriptions, and Social Security information\u2014with third-party advertisers is deeply troubling. That\u2019s why I joined Rep. Guthrie in demanding answers from Covered California. Californians deserve accountability and transparency when their privacy is compromised.",
