                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The US spends between two and three times more per capita on healthcare than other developed countries do on healthcare and achieves worse health outcomes. I questioned @SecKennedy about how artificial intelligence might radically improve healthcare in the United States. It\u2019s time we harness the power of AI to revolutionize patient care and streamline provider efficiency.",
