                "text": "I proudly voted for the FY26 MilCon-VA Appropriations Act which fully funds veterans\u2019 health care, supports military families, and strengthens our national defense. This bill reflects our commitment to those who\u2019ve served, protects American values, and keeps our promises to those who put on the uniform of our country.",
