                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This week I enjoyed meeting with Andrew Goldfrach, CEO of Arrowhead Regional Medical Center\u2014one of the Inland Empire\u2019s premier medical facilities. We discussed innovative ways to improve local healthcare access and quality. I\u2019m committed to supporting ARMC\u2019s mission of delivering high-quality care to the communities that rely on it.",
