                "reply_count": 18,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Our budgeting process should reflect a long-term plan to make our government more efficient and effective. I\u2019ve introduced the Preventive Health Savings Act, which allows the Congressional Budget Office to account for long-term savings from preventive health care. This commonsense reform brings greater accuracy to cost estimates and encourages smarter, fiscally responsible health policy.",
