                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This week I was proud to support the Fiscal Year 2026 Defense Appropriations Act, which provides critical investments to strengthen our military and support our servicemembers. This bill delivers a well-deserved pay raise, improves housing and health care for military families, and ensures our armed forces remain ready to meet the threats of tomorrow.",
