                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Most VA medical services will continue during the federal government shutdown, but some support and administrative functions may face delays as staffing is limited. My offices remain available to assist you with any VA-related issues. \n\nThe Senate should pass the clean Continuing Resolution to reopen the government and ensure our veterans receive the timely services they deserve.\n\nLearn more in my Government Shutdown FAQ: https://t.co/cVGCdeUkBQ",
