                "text": "The federal government shutdown is jeopardizing health care for seniors and rural patients, leaving Medicare telehealth programs, rural clinics, and ambulance services unable to operate normally. These critical programs are being disrupted because a partisan spending feud is holding up funding. It\u2019s time to end the shutdown and get these essential services running again.",
