                "text": "America\u2019s travel and tourism economy thrives when families have more time to enjoy the places they visit. I have long supported giving Americans more daylight in the afternoon because it is better for our health, boosts recreational opportunities, supports small businesses, and improves our quality of life. I will continue advocating for policies that strengthen our economy and help our community thrive.",
