                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I had the pleasure of meeting with constituents representing the National Alliance on Mental Illness. We had a productive conversation on strengthening the mental health workforce through increasing peer support specialists, raising awareness of available resources, and addressing the challenges surrounding mental health funding. I appreciate their advocacy and I remain committed to fighting for policies that improve access to quality mental health care in our community.",
